		"ph.WANDER_WARN": ["Tonight they'll call me from the river. I'll go.", "Hear that? Someone on the other bank calls my name. I'm going tonight.", "There's no one left for me to wait for in that house. I'll go to the river."],
		"ph.WANDER_STAY": ["All right. I'll stay with people tonight.", "Fine. I won't go to the river. Not yet."],
		"bond.grand_parent": "My grandson {name} left a letter at home. I promised to read it only once we're gone.",
		"bond.grand_child": "My grandmother {name} keeps my letter. I'll take it when we get out.",
		"bond.saved": "The door was opened for a reason: {who} and {kin} made it to the end.",
