		"tie.bridge_a": "Waits at the bridge for {who}'s brother. He promised to come.",
		"tie.bridge_b": "{who} waits at the bridge for my brother. I don't have the heart to say he probably won't come.",
		"tie.engaged_day": "{who}, do you remember what we agreed by the chapel? Never mind. Don't answer.",
		"tie.knife_day": "{who}, your husband's knife is on my workbench. Take it when you can.",
